OL,4,CHalf of 18 Kent beaches closed due to  
OL,5,Coil spill reopen                       
OL,6,GNine of the 18 Kent beaches that were  
OL,7,Gclosed due to an oil spill have        
OL,8,Greopened.                              
OL,10,FThanet District Council closed its     
OL,11,Fbeaches on 11 November "to protect the 
OL,12,Fpublic" after the oil was found.       
OL,14,FBeaches along the northern coastline - 
OL,15,Ffrom Minnis Bay to Palm Bay, including 
OL,16,FMargate Main Sands - reopened on       
OL,17,FFriday after oil deposits were cleaned 
OL,18,Fup, the council said. Sites from       
OL,19,FBotany Bay in Broadstairs to Ramsgate  
OL,20,FMain Sands remain closed.              
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
