OL,4,CWoman trapped under car suffers        
OL,5,Cserious injuries                       
OL,6,GA woman who became trapped under her   
OL,7,Gcar in West Sussex has been left with  
OL,8,Gserious injuries.                      
OL,10,FSussex Police found the woman while    
OL,11,Fresponding to an incident in           
OL,12,FDurrington Lane, Worthing, at 18:15    
OL,13,FGMT on Friday.                         
OL,15,FShe was taken to the hospital for      
OL,16,Ftreatment, Sussex Police said.         
OL,18,FThe road was closed for more than two  
OL,19,Fhours as emergency services where at   
OL,20,Fthe scene.                             
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
