OL,4,CFirst patient has surgery at #41.5m    
OL,5,Ccancer centre                          
OL,6,GThe first patient to undergo surgery   
OL,7,Gat a new #41.5m cancer and surgery     
OL,8,Gcentre which opened in Surrey earlier  
OL,9,Gthis month says she feels "enormously  
OL,10,Gprivileged" by the milestone.          
OL,12,FA new Cancer and Surgical Innovation   
OL,13,FCentre at the Royal Surrey County      
OL,14,FHospital in Guildford includes six     
OL,15,Foperating theatres, a short stay ward  
OL,16,Fand specialist facilities.             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
