OL,4,CThe ex-anarchist vicar bringing punk   
OL,5,Cto the church                          
OL,6,GHe has hosted massive Halloween        
OL,7,Gparties in church, held an atheist     
OL,8,Gfuneral and even addressed a           
OL,9,Gcongregation dressed as Elvis Presley. 
OL,11,FSome have criticised Ravi Holy for his 
OL,12,Funorthodox approach, but he says it is 
OL,13,Fpart of his mission to transform       
OL,14,Frelations between the church and       
OL,15,FFolkestone's community.                
OL,17,FSpeaking to the BBC after his recent   
OL,18,Fappointment as the new vicar of The    
OL,19,FTrinity Benefice, the 57-year-old said 
OL,20,Fthat, as a young man, he was an        
OL,21,Fanarchist punk - a spirit that still   
OL,22,Finspired him today.               G4/4 
